      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROTHWELL BONNIE (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by half a length at this track in a handy 26.14 beating Mr. Bluey Lee. Has a low draw and in form and has the ability. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Great chance to get the job done again. ADHANA ROY (1) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (25.86) behind Starbright Hud at Warrnambool. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading player again. BRONZE (4) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (25.67) at Ballarat. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature. FOXY ROXY (8) will need to repeat last run to feature.",
